	"_doc": "Motion rule registry for MotionRules.evaluate (docs/plans/NPC_MOTION_RULES.md section 3). archetypes: per-persona numbers (space radius, RVO radius+priority, yield rank, curiosity, gesture amplitude, head-turn limit in degrees, walk speed, patience, base gait clips, VAT clip set name from vat_bake.json); persona keys of the same name override the archetype. rules: one row per section-3 ID. channels: BODY|LOCO|UPPER|HEAD (an empty list is a data-tier rule that never arbitrates). priority: higher wins inside a channel (reaction_request scale 0..8). min_hold_s: hysteresis, an incumbent keeps its channel that long against equal or lower priority challengers (and latches its last output when its trigger vanishes). tier: the lowest tier the rule runs at (NEAR, MID, FAR). stub: true = the rule function is a no-op, skipped by the engine until its package (the 'package' field) flips it to false. params: the section-3 numbers. suppresses (optional): channels a BODY winner silences (default LOCO and UPPER).",
